A friend of mine had the same problem.  I think that the program has been
written so that you can't play via comms if both computers are running from
the same install disks (for that would be breaking copyright).  What you 
need is to "borrow" another copy from somebody else to install on one of
the machines.  Let me know if you have any success as we never tested this
theory.

